{"id":"A2-L091","title":"Infinitive of purpose: production and review","cefr":"A2","level":"A2","unit":"A2-U06","focus":"Infinitive of purpose — produção e revisão","targets":{"grammar":"Infinitive of purpose — produção e revisão","pron":"Schwa /ə/","verbs":["agree"],"pv":["get along with"],"expr":[],"words":["disturb","celebrate","conflict","peace","building manager","condominium","noise complaint","quiet hours","shared garden","greeting","favor","community spirit","shared rules","tenants’ meeting","potluck dinner","realistic goals"],"field":"Planos","genre":"Editorial / opinião","skill":"Leitura","words_min":16},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 91 · Infinitive of purpose: production and review","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Infinitive of purpose — produção e revisão.","**Verbos:** agree.","**Phrasal verbs:** get along with.","**Pronúncia:** Schwa /ə/.","**10 palavras novas** (planos).","**Texto do dia:** editorial / opinião."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (A2):** eu consigo escrever um editorial com propósito, e usar agree e get along with."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["Você começa a praticar tarefas curtas no formato das provas.","Esta aula treina **ler textos curtos e achar informação (IELTS Reading, TOEFL Reading)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["disturb","incomodar"],["celebrate","comemorar"],["conflict","conflito"],["peace","paz"],["building manager","building manager"],["condominium","condominium"],["noise complaint","noise complaint"],["quiet hours","quiet hours"],["shared garden","shared garden"],["greeting","greeting"],["favor","favor"],["community spirit","community spirit"],["shared rules","shared rules"],["tenants’ meeting","tenants’ meeting"],["potluck dinner","potluck dinner"],["realistic goals","realistic goals"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · An editorial","blocks":[{"type":"text","title":"Why We Need Neighbors","paras":["We live in a building **to share** space, not **to avoid** people. I knock on doors **to say** hello and **to ask** for help. When neighbors **agree** on rules and **get along with** each other, everyone wins.","We should hold meetings **to talk** about problems, and parties **to celebrate**."],"kicker":"OPINION","by":"Building News","gloss":[["knock","bater (na porta)"],["hold","realizar"],["wins","ganha"],["rule","regra"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"We live in a building to avoid people.","ans":"F","why":"not to avoid."},{"q":"The writer knocks to say hello.","ans":"T","why":"to say hello."},{"q":"Meetings help to talk about problems.","ans":"T","why":"to talk about problems."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“knock” = ?","opts":["bater","conhecer","fechar"],"ans":0,"why":"knock."},{"q":"“hold” (meeting) = ?","opts":["realizar","segurar só","guardar"],"ans":0,"why":"hold."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Purpose: production","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Estrutura","Exemplo"],"rows":[["to + verbo","**We hold meetings to talk.**"],["in order to","**in order to avoid problems**"],["so as not to","**so as not to disturb**"],["agree / disagree","**We agree on rules.**"]],"cap":"Purpose: production"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"**get along with** = dar-se bem com: *I get along with my neighbors.*"}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"We hold meetings ___ talk. (to)","a":"to","why":"propósito."},{"s":"Neighbors ___ on the rules. (agree)","a":"agree","why":"agree."},{"s":"I ___ along with everyone. (get)","a":"get","why":"get along with.","say":"get along with"},{"s":"We use the room in order ___ rest. (to)","a":"to","why":"in order to."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["neighbor","vizinho"],["meeting","reunião"],["rule","regra"],["disturb","incomodar"],["celebrate","comemorar"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["meeting","Why","are","we"],"ans":"Why are we meeting","pt":"Por que nos reunimos?"},{"words":["about","the","noise","To","talk"],"ans":"To talk about the noise","pt":"Para falar do barulho."}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"disturb","pos":"word","pt":"incomodar","ex":"Don’t disturb.","expt":"Não incomode."},{"w":"celebrate","pos":"word","pt":"comemorar","ex":"Celebrate together.","expt":"Comemorem juntos."},{"w":"conflict","pos":"word","pt":"conflito","ex":"Avoid conflict.","expt":"Evite conflito."},{"w":"peace","pos":"word","pt":"paz","ex":"Live in peace.","expt":"Viva em paz."},{"w":"building manager","pos":"word","pt":"building manager","ex":"síndico","expt":"The building manager."},{"w":"condominium","pos":"word","pt":"condominium","ex":"condomínio","expt":"A quiet condominium."},{"w":"noise complaint","pos":"word","pt":"noise complaint","ex":"reclamação de barulho","expt":"A noise complaint."},{"w":"quiet hours","pos":"word","pt":"quiet hours","ex":"horário de silêncio","expt":"Quiet hours start at ten."},{"w":"shared garden","pos":"word","pt":"shared garden","ex":"jardim compartilhado","expt":"A shared garden."},{"w":"greeting","pos":"word","pt":"greeting","ex":"cumprimento","expt":"A friendly greeting."},{"w":"favor","pos":"word","pt":"favor","ex":"favor","expt":"Do me a favor."},{"w":"community spirit","pos":"word","pt":"community spirit","ex":"espírito comunitário","expt":"Strong community spirit."},{"w":"shared rules","pos":"word","pt":"shared rules","ex":"regras comuns","expt":"Follow the shared rules."},{"w":"tenants’ meeting","pos":"word","pt":"tenants’ meeting","ex":"reunião de moradores","expt":"A tenants’ meeting."},{"w":"potluck dinner","pos":"word","pt":"potluck dinner","ex":"jantar colaborativo","expt":"A potluck dinner."},{"w":"realistic goals","pos":"word","pt":"realistic goals","ex":"metas realistas","expt":"Realistic goals."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"culture","t":"Expressões desta aula","body":["**Fair enough.** — Justo.","**I couldn’t agree more.** — Concordo plenamente.","**Let’s agree to disagree.** — Vamos concordar em discordar.","**Why are we meeting?** — Por que nos reunimos?","**To talk about the noise.** — Para falar do barulho.","**Do we agree on the new rules?** — Concordamos com as novas regras?","**It’s up in the air.** — Está indefinido."]}]},{"tag":"Verbos","title":"Verbs in focus","blocks":[{"type":"verbs","items":[{"v":"agree","pt":"concordar","forms":[["I / you / we / they agree","I agree with you."],["he / she / it agrees","She agrees with him."]]}]},{"type":"table","head":["Phrasal verb","Significado","Exemplo"],"rows":[["**get along with**","dar-se bem com","I get along with my boss. — Dou-me bem com meu chefe."]],"cap":"Phrasal verbs"}]},{"tag":"Escuta e diálogo","title":"Building meeting","blocks":[{"type":"dialog","title":"Building meeting","lines":[["Ana","Why are we meeting?","Por que nos reunimos?"],["Leo","To talk about the noise.","Para falar do barulho."],["Ana","Do we agree on the new rules?","Concordamos com as novas regras?"],["Leo","Yes. We get along with everyone.","Sim. Nos damos bem com todos."]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: Schwa /ə/","items":[{"label":"Schwa /ə/","note":"Vogais fracas viram /ə/: about, banana, today, the.","words":["about","banana","today","family","another"]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Say why we hold meetings.","pt":"Diga.","model":"We hold meetings to talk about problems."},{"q":"Say who you get along with.","pt":"Diga.","model":"I get along with my neighbors."},{"q":"Say you agree.","pt":"Diga.","model":"I agree with you."}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write a 6-line editorial with purpose.","model":"We live in a building to share space. I knock on doors to say hello. We hold meetings to talk about problems. Neighbors should agree on rules. When we get along with each other, everyone wins.","checklist":["Usei **to + verbo**","Usei **agree e get along with**","Editorial claro"],"words":"6 linhas"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “neighbor” mean?","opts":["reunião","incomodar","vizinho"],"ans":2,"why":"**neighbor** = vizinho."},{"q":"What does “meeting” mean?","opts":["reunião","regra","comemorar"],"ans":0,"why":"**meeting** = reunião."},{"q":"What does “rule” mean?","opts":["incomodar","regra","compartilhado"],"ans":1,"why":"**rule** = regra."},{"q":"What does “disturb” mean?","opts":["comemorar","conflito","incomodar"],"ans":2,"why":"**disturb** = incomodar."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Estratégia para as provas","body":["Treine esta habilidade com o formato de tarefas curtas das provas (TOEFL/IELTS).","Leia o enunciado primeiro e procure as palavras-chave."]},{"type":"box","kind":"teach","t":"Nota para o futuro professor","body":["Use exemplos reais da vida dos alunos e peça frases próprias.","Corrija o erro mais frequente da aula em grupo, sem expor o aluno.","Retome o conteúdo na aula seguinte com um exercício curto."]}]}]}